      "",
      "STEP 2 — Rewrite the SELECTED SPAN ONLY so it:",
      "  • Uses the same defined terms, party names, and capitalizations as the surrounding text",
      "  • Fits the grammatical slot the span sits in",
      "  • Reads coherently when stitched back in place of the span",
      "",
      "STRICT OUTPUT RULES:",
      "  • Return ONLY the words that replace the selected span.",
      "  • Do NOT include surrounding text, quotes, brackets, or commentary.",
      "",
      "FULL PASSAGE (context only — do not rewrite the whole thing):",
